      "objectives": [
        "P1-p10-01",
        "P1-p10-02"
      ],
      "canonical_answer": "Within the stated day: morning, afternoon, evening, night. In Mrs Binta's story: home wash morning; school reading morning; home toy-making afternoon; home storytelling evening; home sleep night. Reading may also occur at home or other times; next morning follows night.",
