      ],
      "canonical_answer": "Stated story: first collect a leaf at home in the afternoon; next draw it at home in the afternoon; last show the picture at school the next morning. Draw is after collect and before show; both contexts and stated parts of day are required. Across-night sequence is explicitly two days.",
